From f9d2b3fa345c770fed733f03f4ccbd6c6ad3bd48 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Shammah Chancellor <shammah.chancellor@notvalid.com>
Date: Thu, 15 Oct 2026 11:40:51 -0700
Subject: [PATCH] Preserve inconclusive validation through disk recovery and
 wallet adapters

Clear and propagate optional deterministic failure evidence, preserving the exact validator fingerprint definition in its new lower layer. Recovery advances or records invalidity only on the corresponding typed result and exact proof binding; local execution limitations leave the durable checkpoint unchanged. Wallet and offline command report inconclusive outcomes explicitly. Root standalone Debug recovery and disk suites pass; independent adapter review found no blocker. Full-tree and new host-guard regression evidence follow separately.
